  "text": "Alex Brown was arrested and charged with burglary for allegedly breaking into a convenience store at night when the store was closed, using a stone to smash a side window. The store owner who has run the store for over 30 years reported that several hundred dollars were taken from the cash register. He described the break-in as devastating, not just financially but emotionally, as the store is both his livelihood and a cornerstone of the neighborhood.",
